a-1daee473ddde","createdAt":1786926560340,"transform":{"position":[-8,3.9970351069797636,106],"rotation":[0,0.5191461142465229,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"web-browser","url":"http://edusim3dweb.com"},{"id":"58c004ef-cea2-4b02-b740-d51e14fb15f4","createdAt":1786926560341,"transform":{"position":[-30,-2.042810365310288e-14,92],"rotation":[0,0.8198672643969563,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"activity-board","options":{"number":1,"title":"Raise the cathedral out of the snow","target":"Click St Basil's → Program.","steps":[{"cat":"motion","text":"move up by 40 feet","depth":0},{"cat":"control","text":"wait 1 seconds","depth":0},{"cat":"control","text":"repeat 20 times","depth":0},{"cat":"motion","text":"move up by -2 feet","depth":1},{"cat":"control","text":"wait 0.1 seconds","depth":1},{"cat":"look","text":"say home","depth":0}],"tip":"Twenty steps of two feet is forty feet, so it lands exactly back where it started. Change the 20 or the -2 and it will not — that arithmetic is the whole trick, and it is the same one that puts a lift on the right floor.","accent":"#c8452f"}},{"id":"1237eaac-4d6b-446c-9d23-3d5c0bc6d4a8","createdAt":1786926560342,"transform":{"position":[30,-2.042810365310288e-14,92],"rotation":[0,-0.8198672643969563,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"activity-board","options":{"number":2,"title":"A parade past the tomb","target":"Click a lamp post on the square → Program.","steps":[{"cat":"control","text":"forever","depth":0},{"cat":"control","text":"duplicate 12 ft away","depth":1},{"cat":"motion","text":"glide 20 feet over 2 seconds","depth":1},{"cat":"look","text":"change color to blue","depth":1},{"cat":"control","text":"wait 1 seconds","depth":1}],"tip":"Duplicate is the only block whose effect leaves its own object, and the copies do NOT inherit it — otherwise one lamp post would become a thousand in about four seconds. Take the forever out and use repeat 5 times instead to line up exactly five.","accent":"#2e5fa8"}},{